+- `immutableManifestSHA256`:
+  `221c543f6dd3cf4a006889afd00ce1a66ea409d1f075dd1c9321852752478fb2`
+- one-LF mutation SHA-256:
+  `389a19b5e967ac58d68c5eacb0054641975065de42853440c18fbe4ffc13a84a`
