+## Artifact hashes
+
+- protocol:
+  `3d67446c3b4223a8500973e4a32a0a0176f219028895a7d45e8dd973875c315a`
+- schema (unchanged):
+  `e0813d9936ec6acc4bf13acd3c4b8104209ce19401e36a4d3001ce72f74c8fcc`
+- valid fixture (unchanged):
